  "description": "A NuGet package providing a reusable base class for loading indicators and background operations in XAML applications. The `LoadingViewModelBase` class extends the property-change notification primitives from `Infrastructure.Foundation` and adds an `IsLoading` state along with a `RunWithLoading<T>` method for safe execution of long-running operations on a background thread. Targets .NET Standard 2.0 and has no direct reference to WPF or any UI framework.",
